<title>USA: EA Industries sets 1-for-4 reverse split.</title>
<headline>EA Industries sets 1-for-4 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>WEST LONG BRANCH, N.J. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>EA Industries Inc said Wednesday it had approved a one-for-four reverse split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The split, effective at the close of business on December 27, will reduce the number of shares outstanding to 5,524,253 from 22,097,012.</p>
<p>EA also said it had hired Legg Mason Wood Walker Inc to assist in selecting and structuring acquisitions for its contract manufacturing operations, and in finding methods to finance the acquisitions either through public or private offerings.</p>
</text>
